0..78 Comment "// Static β at one classifier, the type operators `Type -> Type`: an operator"
79..157 Comment "// applied in a signature reduces before the kernel reads the declaration, and"
158..230 Comment "// the run never sees it. `sum` takes a pair whose type is `apply(twice,"
231..306 Comment "// Integer)`, two static applications deep; `doubled` returns one. Implicit"
307..387 Comment "// parameters `@[…]`, the telescope a use would supply by name, are elaborated"
388..460 Comment "// only for stages (`model/data/sized-higher-order.gandr`); any other is"
461..538 Comment "// refused by name (`ImplicitTelescope`) at the function it opens, and at the"
539..615 Comment "// declaration itself before any other tail, where no corpus expectation can"
616..635 Comment "// state it (#526)."
